<title>USA: CIBCR May US inflation index due at new time Fri.</title>
<headline>CIBCR May US inflation index due at new time Fri.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Center for International Business Cycle Research said its U.S. leading inflation index for May will be released by fax to subscribers at a new time on June 6.</p>
<p>Subscribers can expect it between 0915 EDT/1315 GMT and 0945 EDT.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
